{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1ed295f68a2e532b49bfaae2f6247ee290f86539b3e1636fa70571b734d4830b", "ja": "（真のやつ、新しい衣装を試着してからというもの、\nずっとハイテンションだな。よほど気に入ったらしい）", "zh": "（真自从试穿了新服装之后，就一直情绪高涨啊。看来她非常喜欢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "2849d9b6f713cf26acb265052decd8dbdbc7aa9b2a250af8002a4e0bdfeb1613", "ja": "えへへへ～♪　やっぱりいいなぁ、この衣装！\nポーズつけたりもしちゃおうかな……？", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿～♪ 这套服装果然很棒啊！\n要不要摆个姿势什么的呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "fe507800061d3e57cf572311e7c73d5581600e47b49651cc1e50a24dd258e77a", "ja": "どうするのが一番カワイく見えますかね～？\n控えめ……ううん、意外と大胆なのがいいかも？", "zh": "怎么做看起来最可爱呢～？\n含蓄一点……不，或许意外大胆一些更好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1003_p", "source_sha256": "76e1f55952c1182873156aaecb5bd17dfac1bbd98a1d5be800e15f53a8149a2d", "ja": "真、真。聞くまでもないかもだけど……\n一応、衣装について意見を聞かせてもらえるか？", "zh": "真、真。可能都不用问了……不过，还是能请你说说对服装有什么意见吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "c451d07b8f9a1477da84539f71de2aa94ff3305dca1aac698edb3e509d3484c6", "ja": "最高ですよっ、それ以外にありません！\nやっぱり、カワイイは無限大ですね……へへっ♪", "zh": "太棒了，没有比这更好的了！\n果然，可爱是无限大的呢……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3a1337f1d010c437a07ccff29d1e3104fa07bde2c2918ba841c8aa40ae32372e", "ja": "はは、そうか。今回は、ちょっと大人っぽい\n感じを目指したんだけど、そこはどうかな？", "zh": "哈哈，是吗。这次我想尝试一下稍微成熟一点的感觉，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "970d06ee4ec7c23fc3770b49414266a91a218fa4b09bf62eb15243c01962fe96", "ja": "やっぱりそうなんですね！　ボク、この衣装の\n大人っぽいところがすごく気に入ってて……。", "zh": "果然是这样！我特别喜欢这套服装成熟的一面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "ee012486dad72745f9284fe63ee13349d125cb53e2b746322b48a25e65c486e6", "ja": "キラキラで乙女パワー全開な感じも大好きですけど、\nこれはカワイイだけじゃないっていうか。", "zh": "我也很喜欢这种闪闪发光、少女感十足的感觉，不过这套衣服似乎不只是可爱而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "2e3b8219bb81ce221cdb7d25c6d7d8400070149ec89209d7bd83a689d8790f5b", "ja": "素敵すぎて、ちゃんと着こなせるようにならなきゃ\nって……ちょっとプレッシャー感じちゃうくらいです。", "zh": "实在是太棒了，以至于我觉得自己得好好驾驭它才行……甚至都有点压力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a016cdaa1ad84f48fc716a4095bab670015b8ae4ca8c67ad7c4fd7c7c5b59f5f", "ja": "いや、もう着こなせてると思うぞ、真は。\n今のままでも、ステージで輝けると思う！", "zh": "不，我觉得你已经驾驭得很好了，真。\n现在的你，就足以在舞台上闪闪发光了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "3d43ce63bacbc31c5306ee906bd158de56dd34de14def1908040c6114503f220", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか？　こんなに魅力たっぷりな\n衣装を、ボクは知らない間に……！？", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？这么充满魅力的服装，我竟然在不知不觉间就……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0939cc01281efa8d2ea486637820a062ef3bb1b71f363c96bb5990b3a47b13be", "ja": "今の嬉しそうな真を見れば、一目瞭然だよ。\n衣装は、アイドルを輝かせるためにあるんだから。", "zh": "看看现在真开心的样子，不就一目了然了吗？\n服装就是为了让偶像更加闪耀而存在的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "12897e19f5cc12406fcce7ec9955fd5855120f870fb622c8879a2c6cf1b368e8", "ja": "アイドルを輝かせるために……。そうか。\nその言葉で、不安が吹き飛びました！", "zh": "为了让偶像绽放光彩……原来如此。\n听到这句话，我的不安一下子全消失了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "595d4c77438077e75433ea9e6a87bfc70ba9d9d8c96eca41820e6d4a05cec9c5", "ja": "ボクが衣装の魅力を引き出すんじゃなくて、\n衣装がボクの魅力を引き出してくれるってことですね！", "zh": "不是由我来展现服装的魅力，而是由服装来展现我的魅力，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1014_p", "source_sha256": "35fc70bafa78702583838365b39552e0262140627f02e0b52aec8615aa846209", "ja": "その通りだ。アイドルに……真に合わせてデザイン\nされた衣装が、真に似合わないはずがないよ。", "zh": "没错。为偶像……为真量身设计的服装，怎么可能不适合真呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "103a9bfad3533a0ad9042d5a525dadfbe2d28a014ee96fc340f9ce9745448f31", "ja": "へへっ。じゃあ、あとはこれを着て、ボクが\nどういうパフォーマンスをするかが大事ってことか。", "zh": "嘿嘿。那么，接下来重要的就是穿上这个后，我要展现怎样的表演了，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1016_p", "source_sha256": "cfd5f81c334a564c9f456ec2519b6f1c185f7ddc8c2570c2d4d0e56b107673ab", "ja": "そういうことだ。まあ、いつも通りに楽しめば、\nファンの人に十分、真の可愛さが伝わるはずだよ。", "zh": "就是这样。只要像平时一样享受其中，粉丝们一定能充分感受到真真正正的可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "d379109541a5c5c2c44f5efb2ff408373ad6b781f26f58736b70b0e6b1a1c671", "ja": "だったら任せてください！　次のステージが、\n今から楽しみで仕方ないですから！", "zh": "那就交给我吧！我已经迫不及待地期待下一场舞台了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "d3471521294c9ef059f4edbdfec6e4c88af45e7852358ec2188b17543d6c4371", "ja": "この衣装で、いつも以上にカワイく、\nさらに大人っぽく決めてみせます！", "zh": "穿上这身服装，我一定会比平时更加可爱，展现出更成熟的魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_006mak0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_006mak0374_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2351e7252e3004341d954df4a33d879fd30e0665bb3215f4e454485a5fca997f", "ja": "（真の、可愛さへの憧れは、彼女をより輝かせる。\nいつまでもその気持ちを忘れずにいてくれよ）", "zh": "（真对可爱的憧憬，让她变得更加闪耀。希望你永远都不要忘记这份心情。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
